  << /ActualText (I\047m a Product Designer with around two years of experience designing SaaS products\054 CRM systems\054 AI products\054 and websites\056 I started my career in Journalism and Mass Communication\054 where I first got interested in marketing and design\056 Journalism also taught me how to understand people and communicate clearly\054 which naturally carried into my work in design\056 \nSince moving into product design\054 I\047ve worked across insurance\054 recruitment\054 healthcare\054 construction\054 and EdTech\054 designing products and experiences that are simple and easy to use\056)
